1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,180
M: Did you hear about the mural project our university is doing

2
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,080
I really think you should enter.

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,110
W: Wait, what mural project?

4
00:00:12,110 --> 00:00:15,250
M: They want to create a mural on the side of the student center.

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,570
Students will submit paintings and the judges will select the top five

6
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:23,170
and then those students will lead the official mural committee.

7
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:27,090
W: Are you doing it? The paintings you've done in art class are amazing.

8
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:30,190
M: I already have the newspaper club and Student Council.

9
00:00:30,190 --> 00:00:33,290
W: Well, it sounds interesting. I'll look into it.
